kage bytes with `private, no-store`, `no-referrer`, and `nosniff` headers; no scoring JSON fields or raw asset URLs are emitted.\n- Adds required #1493 method-map receipt and validator-result artifacts.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm run lint:changed` (script reported no changed tracked JS to lint)\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true node_modules/.bin/eslint api/index.js api/lib/http/cors.js api/learning/ms-source-reveal/assets.js api/learning/lib/ms-source-reveal/*.js api/learning/__tests__/ms-source-reveal-asset-api.test.js api/_runtime/route-registry.js api/_runtime/__tests__/route-registry-learning.test.js api/_runtime/__tests__/route-registry-policy-matrix.test.js api/_runtime/__tests__/route-registry-collisions.test.js`\n- `node -e \"for (const p of process.argv.slice(1)) JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync(p, 'utf8'));\" artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-runtime-route-receipt.v1.json artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-runtime-route.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath api/__tests__/api-route-integration.test.js api/learning/__tests__/ms-source-reveal-asset-api.test.js api/_runtime/__tests__/route-registry-learning.test.js api/_runtime/__tests__/route-registry-policy-matrix.test.js api/_runtime/__tests__/route-registry-collisions.test.js`\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T06:25:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T06:54:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T06:54:19Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T06:54:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"c0faeb4767df73fafdef2efa4332a684dc8f071a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1508/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1508/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/c